'' T28, RUN: 'for each' by value over an array of records loaded each element as an
'' aggregate with no size -- '[0 x i8]' against the loop variable's '[8 x i8]' -- and
'' clang refused it on both targets (TKO0113). The load now carries the element's size.
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/foreach-udt-byval.bas -o tests/codegen/foreachudtbyval.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/foreachudtbyval.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/foreachudtbyval.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1 10 2 20 3 30
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 5 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 0 0 2.5 7
